---
import Navigation from '../components/Navigation.jsx';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.jsx';
import ProjectNav from '../components/ProjectNav.jsx';
import "../styles/global.css";
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
        <title>Page Mockup | Kassidy Lewis | Graphic Designer</title>
        <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/portfolio/favicon.svg">
    </head>
    <body id="top" class="font-body text-sm md:text-base">
        <header>
            <nav class="p-6 bg-black" aria-labelledby="site-navigation">
                <Navigation />
            </nav>
        </header>
        <main>
            <section class="pt-6 md:pt-12 pb-12 px-6 md:px-24 xl:px-64">
                <a href="/portfolio/projects/" class="font-semibold hover:text-teal hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-3 transition-all duration-300">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-angles-left mr-1 text-xs"></i>Back to Projects
                </a>
                <h1 class="pt-4 font-display text-6xl xl:text-8xl">Page Mockup</h1>
                <div class="pt-2 grid grid-cols-[2fr_1fr_2fr] gap-4">
                    <img 
                        src="/portfolio/images/design/mockup_desktop.png" 
                        alt="Webpage mockup shown on two desktop monitors" 
                        class="col-span-3 w-full h-full object-cover"
                    >
                    <img 
                        src="/portfolio/images/design/mockup_mobile.png" 
                        alt="Mobile webpage mockup displayed on an iPhone" 
                        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                    >
                    <img 
                        src="/portfolio/images/design/mockup_listings.png" 
                        alt="Screenshot of a webpage that displays a grid of pet listings" 
                        class="col-span-2 w-full h-full object-cover"
                    >
                    <img 
                        src="/portfolio/images/design/mockup_compare.png" 
                        alt="Desktop and mobile designs of a webpage mockup shown side-by-side" 
                        class="col-span-3 lg:col-span-2 w-full h-full object-cover"
                    >
                    <div id="the-objective" class="col-span-3 lg:col-span-1 pt-6 flex">
                        <div class="self-center w-full">
                            <div class="flex justify-between">
                                <h2 class="font-display text-4xl">The Objective</h2>
                                <div class="flex mt-1 gap-2">
                                    <img
                                        src="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-xd.svg"
                                        alt="Logo of Adobe XD"
                                        class="h-7"
                                    >
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <p class="pt-4 lg:pb-4">Creating a static and responsive webpage mockup utilizing Adobe XD.</p>
                            <div class="hidden lg:block -ml-36 h-15 bg-teal mix-blend-exclusion">
                                &nbsp;
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
            <nav class="md:my-12 p-6 md:px-24 lg:px-64 xl:px-96 text-center bg-black text-white" aria-labelledby="page-navigation">
                <em>Jump to:</em>
                <ul class="pt-2 flex justify-center divide-x-3 divide-grey font-semibold transition-all">
                    <li>
                        <a href="#the-objective" class="pr-4 font-semibold hover:text-teal hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-3 transition-all duration-300">
                            Objective
                        </a>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a href="#the-method" class="px-4 font-semibold hover:text-teal hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-3 transition-all duration-300">
                            Method
                        </a>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a href="#the-lesson" class="pl-4 font-semibold hover:text-teal hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-3 transition-all duration-300">
                            Lesson
                        </a>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </nav>
            <div class="px-6 md:px-24 lg:px-64 xl:px-96">
                <section id="the-method" class="py-12 border-b-3 border-grey/25">
                    <h2 class="font-display text-4xl">The Method</h2>
                    <p class="py-4">Every building requires a foundation, and every website is built upon a design system. The goal of this project was to establish the visual style of a webpage and to construct a static "preview" out of it.</p>
                    <p>Given the choice of theme, I decided on a pet-centric design, as pet websites have straightforward imagery and objectives that would be simple to identify and replicate. (Also, who doesn't love puppies?)</p>
                    <div class="py-6 text-center">
                        <img 
                            src="/portfolio/images/design/mockup_mood.png" 
                            alt="Moodboard for a webpage mockup including color, fonts, and button styles" 
                            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                        >
                        <p class="pt-2 text-grey">Moodboard establishing colors, fonts, and button styles.</p>
                    </div>
                    <p class="pb-4">The mockup was created with three adjectives in mind: playful, inviting, and reliable. The first two descriptors are established in font and color choices, as well as the jolly directives of the site. Reliability is evident in the grouping of information and consistency of margins, font sizes, etc.</p>
                    <p>Animated elements were also considered, despite the mockup being primarily static. The end result would allow the user to scroll through and filter hundreds of local pet listings.</p>
                </section>
                <section id="the-lesson" class="py-12 border-b-3 border-grey/25">
                    <h2 class="font-display text-4xl">The Lesson</h2>
                    <p class="pt-4">This project was a fundamental exercise in the prototyping capabilities of Adobe XD, as well as in responsive design, as it includes both desktop and mobile versions of the mockup. It encouraged the mobile-first mindset that I would later tap into while <a href="/portfolio/portfolio-site/" class="font-semibold hover:text-teal hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-3 transition-all duration-300">developing this portfolio website</a>. The ideation period is also a crucial component of web development, and this project has familiarized me with the process.</p>
                </section>
                <nav class="py-12" aria-labelledby="project-navigation">
                    <ProjectNav
                        src_left="/portfolio/images/design/portfolio_home.png"
                        alt_left="Mobile and desktop versions of a portfolio website shown side-by-side"
                        link_left="/portfolio/portfolio-site/"
                        name_left="Portfolio Website"
                        src_right="/portfolio/images/design/alesco_overview.png"
                        alt_right="Logo designs for Alesco Design Solutions"
                        link_right="/portfolio/logo-work/"
                        name_right="Logo Work"
                    />
                </nav>
            </div>
        </main>
        <footer class="py-12 px-6 md:px-24 lg:px-64 xl:px-96 text-white bg-black">
            <Footer />
        </footer>
        <!-- Scripts -->
        <script src="https://kit.fontawesome.com/f3040639fe.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
        <noscript>Your browser does not support JavaScript!</noscript>
    </body>
</html>